                            <p>Thanks for participating in this HIT!</p>

                            <b/><p class="mb-2">You will read multiple-choice questions about daily life. For each question, an answer has been selected and 2 explanations for the answer have been given. Your task is to select the explanation that best explains the answer.</p>
                            <br/>
                            <p class="mb-2" style="margin-left: 40px"><b>Each HIT contains 3 parts:</b>
                            </p><div class="legend" style="margin-left: 40px">
                                <div class="row"><span class="label col-3"><span class="concept_a">Question</span></span><span class="col-9">A question such as "If a lantern is not for sale, where is it likely to be?"</span></div>
